OL,3,GNEWSABarbells and beats: This is the
OL,4,Anew student night out
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom pecs to decks, students in
OL,7,FNottingham are trying a new workout
OL,8,Fthat turns a gym into a club night.
OL,10,FThere's no alcohol involved... just
OL,11,Fhigh-energy drinks and pure adrenaline.
OL,13,FFriends Phoebe Constanta and Ella
OL,14,FBirkwood, second-year students at
OL,15,FNottingham Trent University, are among
OL,16,Fthose trying the new night that
OL,17,Fcombines pumping iron with pumping
OL,18,Ftunes.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
