OL,3,GNEWSABarbells and beats: This is the
OL,4,Anew student night out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said they were looking for "a new
OL,7,Fgym to try out" and decided to go along
OL,8,Fto Castle After Dark, a new
OL,9,Falcohol-free student event at a city
OL,10,Fcentre gym.
